<SCENARIO VER="105">
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<TXSPN>I held down <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE>, who had reflexively tried to step in and stop her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! What are you doing!? Let go!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, don't!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\se_fuon2低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And just like that, the mace came swinging straight down at <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s screaming and <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE>'s shrieks faded out― 
{PAUSE ""}
and time around me slowed down.<PG>
What on earth am I doing?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That mace is coming down on <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>, isn't it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> is about to be killed, isn't she?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> leapt out to stop it, didn't she?<PG>
Why am I holding <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> back?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At this rate <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> is definitely going to be killed, isn't she?<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>'s warning, was this what it meant?
{PAUSE ""}
　That flashed through my head and I held <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> back, but the very next instant I doubted myself, wondering if it was a mistake.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE>, too, used her whole body in my arms to refuse what I was doing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's right, any way I looked at it, I was wrong.<PG>
To begin with, just because it's <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>'s warning doesn't necessarily mean it means I mustn't get in the way of <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> as she is now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Should I let go of <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> even now and stop <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>?<PG>
No... 
{PAUSE ""}
it was too late.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Time had slowed only around me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The mace was surely closing in on <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>'s head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I let go of <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> now, even if I leapt out, it was already too late.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I... 
{PAUSE ""}
I...!
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\血しぶき背景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\春花子供かばう.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MOTION "789" "人物2" "3" "0" "500" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\赤背景.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "12" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "12" "200" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
